---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="404 · Página no encontrada / Page not found" noindex hideStickyCTA>
  <section class="not-found">
    <span class="display-no">404</span>
    <h1>Página no encontrada<br /><span lang="en">Page not found</span></h1>
    <div class="recovery">
      <div lang="es"><p>El enlace puede haber cambiado. Podés volver al inicio o explorar nuestros departamentos.</p><a class="cta-pill" href="/">Volver al inicio →</a><a class="link-acc" href="/#unidades">Ver departamentos →</a></div>
      <div lang="en"><p>This link may have changed. Return to the homepage or explore our apartments.</p><a class="cta-pill" href="/en/">Back to home →</a><a class="link-acc" href="/en/#unidades">View apartments →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .not-found { padding: 130px 28px 80px; max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; }
  .display-no { font-size: clamp(70px,14vw,150px); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(28px,4vw,48px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .recovery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; margin-top: 32px; }
  p { line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .link-acc { display: block; padding: 18px 0; }
  @media(max-width:720px) { .recovery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .not-found { padding-inline: 18px; } }
</style>
